    "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490020/extras/486d1d027e293fea2c31daf0d322f2b5.poster.avif?t=1752609139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490020/extras/486d1d027e293fea2c31daf0d322f2b5.webm?t=1752609139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490020/extras/486d1d027e293fea2c31daf0d322f2b5.mp4?t=1752609139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490020/extras/cdf0060346cf90630b0fd5280ff4a132.poster.avif?t=1752609139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490020/extras/cdf0060346cf90630b0fd5280ff4a132.webm?t=1752609139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490020/extras/cdf0060346cf90630b0fd5280ff4a132.mp4?t=1752609139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>TIC-TAC: Twelve o'clock</strong> is inspired by cult horror classics of the early '90s. After several students went missing, the police shut down Bluebird High School without any official explanation. A group of schoolchildren doesn\u2019t understand why. Jerry, River, Corey, and Will begin their own investigation to uncover the truth.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORYLINE</h2>River sneaked into the control room with a generator to check the security cameras. While monitoring the cameras River spotted something mysterious, <strong>the ghost of a murdered girl</strong> who had gone missing - Jennifer.<br><br>Try to survive until dawn, not only Jennifer wants to kill you. Use the security cameras to monitor the corridors and rooms around you. Charge the generator, you need it to lock the doors and keep the lights on. <strong>Don't get caught!</strong><br><br>Your friends,<br>Jerry, Corey, and Will<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">USE THE SECURITY CAMERAS</h2><strong>Monitor the security cameras to spot any anomalies.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490020/extras/ghosts.gif?t=1752609139\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LOCK THE DOORS TO SURVIVE</h2><strong>They are coming! Lock the doors to stay alive.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490020/extras/door.gif?t=1752609139\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BE READY, DANGER IS ALL AROUND YOU</h2><strong>It is everywhere.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490020/extras/7faa1fec225c31f3d3a074ed7c644eb3.poster.avif?t=1752609139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490020/extras/7faa1fec225c31f3d3a074ed7c644eb3.webm?t=1752609139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490020/extras/7faa1fec225c31f3d3a074ed7c644eb3.mp4?t=1752609139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEEP THE GENERATOR CHARGED</h2><strong>Charge the generator \u2014 it is your chance to survive.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490020/extras/e085985e4d953ba697825c84326bcbe9.poster.avif?t=1752609139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490020/extras/e085985e4d953ba697825c84326bcbe9.webm?t=1752609139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490020/extras/e085985e4d953ba697825c84326bcbe9.mp4?t=1752609139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>TIC-TAC: Twelve o'clock</strong> is inspired by cult horror classics of the early '90s. After several students went missing, the police shut down Bluebird High School without any official explanation. A group of schoolchildren doesn\u2019t understand why. Jerry, River, Corey, and Will begin their own investigation to uncover the truth.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORYLINE</h2>River sneaked into the control room with a generator to check the security cameras. While monitoring the cameras River spotted something mysterious, <strong>the ghost of a murdered girl</strong> who had gone missing - Jennifer.<br><br>Try to survive until dawn, not only Jennifer wants to kill you. Use the security cameras to monitor the corridors and rooms around you. Charge the generator, you need it to lock the doors and keep the lights on. <strong>Don't get caught!</strong><br><br>Your friends,<br>Jerry, Corey, and Will<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">USE THE SECURITY CAMERAS</h2><strong>Monitor the security cameras to spot any anomalies.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490020/extras/ghosts.gif?t=1752609139\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LOCK THE DOORS TO SURVIVE</h2><strong>They are coming! Lock the doors to stay alive.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490020/extras/door.gif?t=1752609139\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BE READY, DANGER IS ALL AROUND YOU</h2><strong>It is everywhere.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490020/extras/7faa1fec225c31f3d3a074ed7c644eb3.poster.avif?t=1752609139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490020/extras/7faa1fec225c31f3d3a074ed7c644eb3.webm?t=1752609139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490020/extras/7faa1fec225c31f3d3a074ed7c644eb3.mp4?t=1752609139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEEP THE GENERATOR CHARGED</h2><strong>Charge the generator \u2014 it is your chance to survive.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490020/extras/e085985e4d953ba697825c84326bcbe9.poster.avif?t=1752609139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490020/extras/e085985e4d953ba697825c84326bcbe9.webm?t=1752609139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490020/extras/e085985e4d953ba697825c84326bcbe9.mp4?t=1752609139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "\ud83d\udd26 TIC-TAC: Twelve o'clock is a survival horror game. You must stay alive for FIVE NIGHTS in the abandoned Bluebird High School. \ud83d\udd6f\ufe0fTry to survive until dawn. Use security cameras to monitor corridors and rooms around you. Keep the lights on and the generator charged, ... and don't get caught!",
